WEBVTT

00:01.920 --> 00:03.280
Brilliant

00:03.360 --> 00:04.760
Brilliant

00:04.880 --> 00:06.160
You

00:06.240 --> 00:07.907
Are Commandant Chu's student, right?

00:09.880 --> 00:11.160
This humble one is Zhu Yuanzhi

00:11.240 --> 00:13.040
Entrusted by my teacher Chu Huan

00:13.120 --> 00:15.453
To come and serve Prince of Jin

00:18.560 --> 00:19.960
My stepping stone

00:22.240 --> 00:24.573
Since Commandant Chu values you so highly

00:24.800 --> 00:26.120
From now on

00:26.200 --> 00:27.640
Serve under my command

00:28.360 --> 00:29.760
Don't disappoint me

00:30.680 --> 00:30.960
Thank

00:31.040 --> 00:32.440
Prince of Jin

00:38.440 --> 00:39.680
We're going to the banquet

00:39.760 --> 00:41.427
Shouldn't we prepare a gift?

00:43.640 --> 00:46.973
What about the jade thumb ring I gave you before?

00:48.240 --> 00:48.800
General Zu Kun

00:48.880 --> 00:49.800
This is important

00:49.920 --> 00:51.280
That gift would be perfect

00:51.360 --> 00:52.400
Well

00:52.480 --> 00:53.880
Let me think
